cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this work, please cite it using these metadata."

title: "Van Aubel Extensions"

authors:
  - given-names: "Charles"
    alias: "mindofcharles"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8326-876X"

abstract: >-
  A mathematical study of Van Aubel's theorem through complex structures,
  including higher-dimensional realizations, edge-operator classification and rigidity,
  configuration-dependent defects and mixed-sign loci, rank and unitary normal forms
  of square-zero antilinear maps, exact real operator norms for exceptional edge
  structures, and complex-affine naturality and transfer.
  The repository also contains Lean 4 formal proofs,
  numerical consistency tests, and an interactive demonstration.

keywords:
  - "Van Aubel theorem"
  - "complex structures"
  - "affine geometry"
  - "Euclidean geometry"
  - "mixed-sign loci"
  - "antilinear maps"
  - "normal forms"
  - "operator norms"
  - "Lean"
  - "formal verification"

repository-code: "https://github.com/mindofcharles/Van-Aubel-Extensions"

